      },
      "text": "Costa Rican coffee and chocolate"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:highlight_text:da3112e076feb31b",
      "field": "highlight.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4e975a9e3ecd2d8cd0b40243d8c6a357ba7c51ed9bdd1248f206fd934d0c8fbd",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-97965d11-b9ef-45cd-a2d6-8f41fb371543",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "The programme includes two food tours centred on local produce. At a cacao plantation, you’ll see how cacao is planted and harvested, how the beans are dried and ground, and how they’re made into hot chocolate.\n\nAt the Doka coffee plantation, the tour covers growing, harvesting, processing and roasting coffee. It ends with a tasting, and you can buy Costa Rican coffee at the farm."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:06f9555d367b3cf6",
      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "57ddfbb645a6f136561c1b6fd9466f5e8d09098866bf75bc05229896c6d93e3f",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-97965d11-b9ef-45cd-a2d6-8f41fb371543",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Red and yellow cacao pods growing on a tree trunk at a Costa Rican plantation"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_hover:6039b0513182f047",
      "field": "media.hover",
      "sourceTextSha256": "100f43ed4adf9fbc36e2ed84b06ba0066d304ddac0db62d1a9d10597928359e3",
